- For non-trivial feature work, identify the governing SYS/TECH/ADR and feature package first.
- `spec.md` owns behavior; `plan.md` owns implementation; `tasks.md` owns execution; `test-plan.md` owns validation.
- If approved docs conflict, stop and report the conflict.
- Do not implement a design decision that is explicitly TBD.
